### ==========================================
### 4. DERIVED QUERIES, PAGINATION & SORTING TESTS (Day 6)
### ==========================================

### 4a. Get All Products with Pagination (Page 0, Size 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?page=0&size=5

### 4b. Get Next Page (Page 1, Size 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?page=1&size=5

### 4c. Filter by Category (Category 1 - Dairy)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?categoryId=1

### 4d. Search by Product Name ("milk")
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?search=milk

### 4e. Sorting by Price (Descending)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?sort=price,desc

### 4f. Sorting by Price (Ascending)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?sort=price,asc

### 4g. COMBINED QUERY: Category + Search + Sorting + Pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products?categoryId=1&search=milk&page=0&size=5&sort=price,asc

### 4h. BONUS CHALLENGE: Low Stock Products (stockQuantity < 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/shops/1/products/low-stock?threshold=5